WEBVTT

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:12.040
"Tower of Fangs"

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:28.290
"Azalie"

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:28.290
Don't look at me...

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:30.750
But he looked.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.750
"Krylancelo"

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:35.080
Or rather, he was paralyzed
and couldn't move.

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:38.830
All he could do was stare at her in shock.

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:42.040
Please don't look at me. I'm begging you...

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:44.660
Azalie... Are you crying?

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:48.250
Please... Leave, Krylancelo!

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:49.910
Where's Master?

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:54.250
Just leave! Please!

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:59.250
Azalie! Your hand...

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:02.830
What in the world is going on?

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:06.200
The sword...

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:13.700
I exist as both the beginning and as the end.

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:15.910
"Childman"

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:15.910
Much like the monster named Time itself.

00:01:15.910 --> 00:01:17.910
The Soon-Another...

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:30.700
The experiment failed...

00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:05.330
"Leticia"

00:02:05.330 --> 00:02:06.830
"Forte"

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:10.540
Master!

00:02:11.040 --> 00:02:13.450
"Comicron"                                             "Heartia"

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:13.450
What...

00:02:13.450 --> 00:02:15.120
That's...

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:26.330
O Lightning!

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:31.040
Stop!

00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:41.450
I unsheathe thee, Sword of Light!

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:53.330
Krylancelo!

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:55.410
Azalie!

00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:59.330
Azalie!

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:02.660
Azalie!

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:40.580
The Kiesalhima Continent,
approximately a thousand years ago.

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:44.410
The Dwarves that have lived
on the land since time immemorial

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:49.870
were chased away to the ends of
the continent by Dragons that had invaded.

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:54.500
And then Sorcerers were born
between the Dragons

00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:57.910
and the humans who had
drifted onto the continent.

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:03.120
"The Vestige of the Past"

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:07.000
"The Tower of 
Fangs, 5 years later"

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:25.370
"The western part of
 the Continent, Totokanta"

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:25.370
Hold it! Stop running!

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:29.120
Wait, damn it!

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:30.450
Hey!

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:37.040
I strike thee, Glass Hail!

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:46.200
Hey, what's the big idea?

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:48.250
That's my line!

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:53.290
You were supposed to pay me back
the money you owe me three months ago!

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:56.750
A baby would be able to stand up while
holding onto something during that time!

00:05:56.750 --> 00:06:00.160
Like I care, you moron!
Like it'd be able to eat baby food by then!

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:02.120
Actually, they probably would...

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:04.250
Who the hell cares about any of that?!

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:06.580
Hurry up and pay me the money
I let you two borrow!

00:06:06.580 --> 00:06:10.290
You're threatening both of us,
but it's my brother that borrowed the money.

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:10.080
"Smack"

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:14.080
Dortin, you traitor! How dare you
sell out your own flesh and blood?!

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:18.250
But Bro, fertilized eggs
can create their own blood,

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:21.660
so we actually don't share blood as brothers.
Not even with our parents--

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:27.290
Again, who the hell cares?!
Just give me back my money!

00:06:27.290 --> 00:06:28.910
I've got no money to give you!

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:32.000
Stop talking nonsense,
you money-lending Sorcerer!

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:35.080
What was that, you little thief?!

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:39.450
Flow Thus! Angel Breath!

00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:43.120
Just hurry up and
give me back my damn money!

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:45.080
Hey!

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:47.370
So we meet at last!

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:52.290
I've finally found you,
wandering criminals Volkan and Dortin!

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:54.330
Wandering criminals?

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:57.450
Did you two cause trouble in other places, too?

00:06:57.450 --> 00:07:00.700
I've come all this way to capture you two!

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:04.410
A police officer dispatched here
from the Royal Security Police?!

00:07:04.410 --> 00:07:05.790
Run away!

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:07.580
You're not getting away from me!

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:12.620
Oh, I'm so sorry!

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:15.830
No fair! You two are so small and hard to hit!

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:18.160
Could you stop with the darts, please?!

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:20.450
I'm supposed to arrest them in a
fun manner while leaving minimum casualties.

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:22.410
Did I do something wrong?

00:07:22.410 --> 00:07:24.450
How about no casualties?!

00:07:24.450 --> 00:07:28.540
Look who's talking! You're the one
who used Sorcery out on the streets!

00:07:28.540 --> 00:07:31.330
Oh, shut up! At least I held back!

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:32.250
Damn those two!

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:34.700
Hey! The guy you hit with those darts...

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:36.370
His body's spazzing out!

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:39.660
Crap! I forgot I coated them with an anesthetic!

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:42.330
Hey, are you able to heal him?

00:07:44.620 --> 00:07:47.910
I repair thee, Scars of the Sunset.

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:55.250
Thank goodness.
I guess I'll let you off the hook.

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:56.580
You should be grateful.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:58.200
Grateful, my ass!

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:03.500
But I guess drop-out Sorcerers
like you can actually be useful.

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:11.500
Drop-out Sorcerer, huh?

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:18.540
Here you are, Orphen.

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:20.660
Thanks, Majic.

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:27.410
Orphen, I was watching from the windows.

00:08:27.410 --> 00:08:31.080
When you used Sorcery on those Dwarves!

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:32.250
It was truly amazing!

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:35.580
I mean, I've only seen the lot
that calls themselves Sorcerers

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:37.870
when they can barely even use Sorcery,

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:42.700
or those who can use a spell or two
and use them to con people.

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:46.500
Dad! Orphen's nothing like them!

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:49.500
Um, I've been meaning to ask this for a while,

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:51.950
but that's the emblem
that's given to the Black Sorcerers

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:54.290
who trained at the Tower of Fangs, right?

00:08:54.290 --> 00:08:55.580
Yup.

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:58.950
That means you were
at the Tower of Fangs, right?

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:00.080
Well, yeah.

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:03.120
So you trained under the best
Black Sorcerers in the land!

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:05.450
That's so amazing.

00:09:05.450 --> 00:09:08.870
What? You want to be
a Sorcerer, or something?

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:13.290
Well, my mother comes
from a family of Sorcerers.

00:09:13.290 --> 00:09:16.750
Then you might have
a knack for Sorcery, as well.

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:18.290
Really?

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:20.200
I think I sense something from you, too.

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:23.620
Then would you be willing to teach me Sorcery?

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:27.290
Well, if you pay me a monthly fee,
I guess I wouldn't mind teaching you--

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:30.410
Come on, now. Don't try to coerce
my son into anything shady

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:33.910
just because you've got
a tab building up at my inn.

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:36.790
A powerful Sorcerer would never
become an illegal moneylender,

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:39.870
no matter how hard things may be.

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:43.910
He's lying about you having a knack, too.

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:45.830
Man, that's harsh.

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:48.910
I wasn't lying about anything.

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:53.750
Why would you even think Majic has
a knack to become a Sorcerer anyway?

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:57.540
The fact that he's descended
from Sorcerers, and...

00:09:57.540 --> 00:10:00.410
His pure, sincere passion.

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:02.950
That's what you need to become a Sorcerer.

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:05.580
Don't give up if you want to become one.

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:10.620
But I'm...

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:13.450
Welcome.

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:16.290
Wow, you actually got a customer for once.

00:10:16.290 --> 00:10:19.330
I've got a sweet deal for you.

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:22.450
You two!

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:28.580
You don't see that
police officer anywhere, do you?

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:30.660
All right. All clear. Get out here!

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:35.910
Why do I have to do this?

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:38.950
Well, you want the money
we borrowed from you back, right?

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:41.410
Then I'll let you in on this sweet deal.

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:43.370
We'll be splitting the profits 50-50 though.

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:46.250
You're the one who owes
me money, remember?

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:48.870
And you can't pay for
your room at the inn, can you?

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:51.080
And that's your fault!

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:54.120
So, what do you want me to do now
that you've got me in this stupid outfit?

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:56.120
You'll know when we get there.

00:10:56.120 --> 00:10:59.250
What the hell? Sure is quiet around here.

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:03.040
Well, apparently something
appeared in a village nearby.

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:04.620
What do you mean by something?

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:09.120
We're not entirely sure, but that's
probably why people aren't coming outside.

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:11.080
Who cares? Let's go!

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:13.910
This better not be anything shady.

00:11:20.160 --> 00:11:22.250
So, any update?

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:26.750
"You better have some details
after making me wait all this time," eh?

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:32.950
How many times do I have to tell you
to stop reading people's thoughts?

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:36.120
You should always use abilities you acquire.

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:38.080
And what if you can't?

00:11:38.080 --> 00:11:41.290
What you just thought right now is my answer.

00:11:41.290 --> 00:11:45.120
Yes... You'll end like him or her.

00:11:47.410 --> 00:11:51.500
Haven't you ever thought an overwhelming
ability could actually destroy someone?

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:54.160
Are you talking about us?

00:11:54.160 --> 00:11:58.790
Then wouldn't you be
disavowing Sorcery overall?

00:11:58.790 --> 00:12:03.870
No. I know the meaning of training.

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:08.290
We've been risking our lives training here.

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:11.450
In order to control powerful Sorcery.

00:12:11.450 --> 00:12:13.500
Not to make it more powerful.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:18.870
But as a result, your Sorcery
did become more powerful, Tish.

00:12:18.870 --> 00:12:22.200
To the point where people
now call you the Scream of Death.

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:25.290
Could we not use that nickname?

00:12:25.290 --> 00:12:29.410
Doesn't it feel like kids teaching
some tricks they learned to each other?

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:33.370
But there's a point in keeping
that name if it proves effective, Tish.

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:35.080
Could you also stop calling me "Tish"?

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:40.290
Then what shall we call her,
after she reappeared five years later?

00:12:40.290 --> 00:12:43.790
The Chaos... No.

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:46.450
The Former Chaos Witch.

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:51.870
O Wind!

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:08.120
That thing's insane.

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:09.830
We have to take it down.

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:13.200
We've been ordered by the elders
of the Tower to annihilate it!

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:18.200
Azalie...

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:29.500
Where's it going?

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:34.330
Beyond those mountains lies Totokanta.

00:13:42.660 --> 00:13:48.080
There's no one that doesn't know
the name Burplewarts in Mebrenst!

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:50.000
Burplewarts?!

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:52.450
Oh, come on, Mr. Warts!

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:55.660
I know you're nervous seeing such
a beautiful lady in front of you,

00:13:55.660 --> 00:13:58.580
but get too excited and it's bad for your heart.

00:13:58.580 --> 00:14:03.410
Do you come from a long line of
nobles since you're from Mebrenst?

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:05.250
Noble?!

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:09.250
Why yes, he does! He actually runs
his own business now though.

00:14:09.250 --> 00:14:10.750
Oh, what kind?

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:13.330
He makes sleeping pills.

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:14.500
Bro...?

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:16.540
Why sleeping pills?!

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:21.040
Of course a high-class lady like
her would have need for sleeping pills!

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:24.450
Please excuse us a moment.

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:26.830
Mariabelle.

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:33.700
You lamebrain Sorcerer!
Haven't you ever heard of ad-libbing?!

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:35.200
Ad-libbing?!

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:41.620
You put me in this rental suit, dragged me
to this giant mansion without a single explanation,

00:14:41.620 --> 00:14:44.370
and my name's supposed to be Burplewarts?!

00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:49.040
I had no idea about this.
My bro set this all up.

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:50.250
Damn right, I did!

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:53.790
There's no way Dortin could've
ever set up such an elaborate schem--

00:14:53.790 --> 00:14:55.750
It's too elaborate!

00:14:55.750 --> 00:14:58.540
Not to mention, doesn't
marriage fraud usually involve

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:01.910
some girl who lives on her own
and doesn't know the ways of the world?

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:06.450
If you marry into the Everlasting Family,
you'll have a hand at their inheritance.

00:15:06.450 --> 00:15:09.870
Then our debt would go poof!

00:15:09.870 --> 00:15:13.750
You little twerp!
You didn't think this through at all!

00:15:13.750 --> 00:15:16.540
Let go! I can't breathe!

00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:20.290
Madame?

00:15:20.290 --> 00:15:21.290
Miss?

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:24.870
Oh, my bad.

00:15:24.870 --> 00:15:28.370
Uh... Er, yes, come in.

00:15:28.370 --> 00:15:33.750
I totally forgot to knock.
I hope you don't think I'm rude.

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:35.000
Who are you?

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:36.250
I'm Claiomh!

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:38.790
I'm the second daughter
in the Everlasting Family.

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:39.870
Pleased to meet you.

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:42.660
I absolutely love having guests over!

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:46.250
They bring in the air
from outside with them, after all.

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:49.540
I've never been outside of Totokanta.

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:52.950
By the way, you guys...

00:15:52.950 --> 00:15:55.330
...are trying to commit marriage fraud, right?

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:57.750
Hey, are you gonna trick my sister?

00:15:57.750 --> 00:16:00.370
How badly are you gonna pull one
over on her? Come on, tell me!

00:16:00.370 --> 00:16:05.040
Oh, yeah. I was eavesdropping
right outside the door.

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:07.040
For how long...?

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:09.540
I'm pretty sure it was towards the beginning.

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:13.950
Oh, by the way, my mom and sis
were discussing if they should

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:15.660
call the police on you or not.

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:18.120
They're also trying to retrieve some weapons

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:20.620
from our armory to teach you guys a lesson.

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:23.160
I'm innocent! I definitely
didn't plan any of this!

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:25.910
We of the Continental Sorcerer's Association

00:16:25.910 --> 00:16:29.160
were sent to check how resilient
civilians are against con artists!

00:16:29.160 --> 00:16:31.250
It was him! He dragged me into all of this!

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:34.580
I absolutely did not!

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:34.580
We are fighting against crime daily!

00:16:34.580 --> 00:16:38.200
That's it! This evil Black Sorcerer
brainwashed me, and--

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:41.160
Oh, shut up!

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:44.330
Here I am, trying to talk our way out of this,

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:47.250
and you had to go and ruin it!

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:50.370
Oh, I know! You must be comedians.

00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:51.870
You guys surprise people and then suddenly

00:16:51.870 --> 00:16:55.450
come out with a sign saying it was all a prank.

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:54.370
"The Original"
"Candid Camera"

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:57.160
You're exactly right, miss!

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:59.330
Just so you know,
the sentence for fraud is 15 years.

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:01.080
Huh?

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:03.250
I'm telling you I was tricked!

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:07.000
But apparently, it looks
like you really are a Sorcerer.

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:11.120
Yes... Oh, and I can also do repairs, as well.

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:14.040
I repair thee, Scars of the Sunset.

00:17:17.290 --> 00:17:19.750
Wow!

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:23.450
Come to think of it, another
Sorcerer came to our home before, too.

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:25.540
Is that so?

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:30.790
They came to see my father.
I guess he was helping them out.

00:17:30.790 --> 00:17:34.700
Oh, my father passed away
two years ago due to an illness.

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:36.870
I'm very sorry to hear that.

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:39.700
They said they were from Tafrem.

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:41.790
They were wearing some kind of pendant.

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:44.830
Well, the Tower of Fangs is in Tafrem.

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:47.000
The place is crawling with Sorcerers...

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:56.370
Do you remember what
this Sorcerer looked like?

00:17:57.540 --> 00:18:02.910
It was a guy who was pretty muscular,
and he had black hair that was tied back.

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:16.200
We have now entered the city of Totokanta.

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:19.450
Master.

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:20.910
Heartia.

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:22.000
Who's that?

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:24.160
He's one of Childman's students

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:28.790
and is currently the secretary at the Totokanta
branch of The Continental Sorcerers' Association.

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:30.830
When did he come by?

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:34.500
It was before I started school,
so quite a while ago.

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:38.830
Oh, but someone pretty similar
showed up about five years ago...

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:44.330
They apparently came to deliver
something important to my father.

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:47.450
Could it be...

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:49.160
Huh?

00:18:49.160 --> 00:18:52.080
Could it possibly be...

00:18:54.450 --> 00:18:55.910
Hurry!

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:08.910
Hey, let's get the heck outta here!

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:10.450
Mr. Burplewarts!

00:19:10.450 --> 00:19:14.000
I'm not Burplewarts. The name's Orphen.

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:15.700
Orphen...

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:17.410
Like orphan?

00:19:17.410 --> 00:19:21.000
Yeah, pretty much.

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:23.120
Mother? Sis?

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:26.160
Hey, let's get the heck
outta here, Black Sorcerer!

00:19:32.160 --> 00:19:36.620
Damn it! Looks like I'm putting
my neck on the line again!

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:47.500
I request thine invitation, Untrodden Gate.

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:55.500
Mother! Sis!

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:13.000
Azalie!

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:14.080
I...

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:15.750
It's me!

00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:17.700
I've been searching for you this whole time!

00:20:17.700 --> 00:20:19.620
Azalie!

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:36.330
Azalie!

00:20:39.370 --> 00:20:40.790
That sword...

00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:47.870
Over here!

00:20:55.410 --> 00:20:57.330
Stop!

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:10.250
Who are you?

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:18.250
Fire!

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:35.000
I unsheathe thee, Sword of Light!

00:23:37.200 --> 00:23:41.620
The only thing that can take down
that monster is your stupid magic!

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:43.000
That's not a monster.

00:23:43.000 --> 00:23:46.950
If you keep spewing nonsense,
I'm gonna stab your brain with an ear pick!

00:23:44.950 --> 00:23:46.950
"Tower of Fangs"
